  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\nAbbreviation of フォローバック (follow back), itself from English.\n\nUSAGE:\nフォロバ is standard internet/social media vocabulary in Japanese, commonly seen on platforms like X (formerly Twitter) and Instagram. It can be used as a noun or with する.\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- フォロー: to follow (on social media)\n- リフォロー: another term for following back\n- {相互|そうご}フォロー: mutual follow",
